# Omnichannel Marketing Automation

Category: Business Management Solutions

Automate lead nurturing, email newsletters, SMS reminders, and WhatsApp marketing campaigns.

Stop sending generic blasts that get ignored. Our Omnichannel Marketing Automation platforms enable you to build behavioral triggers across SMS, WhatsApp, and email. Qualify leads dynamically, retarget abandoned checkouts, schedule birthday discounts, and update customer profiles in real time based on their real engagement, maximizing lifetime value automatically.

Key features:
- Visual Flow Builder: Drag-and-drop builder for multi-channel communication journeys. Clear campaign planning.
- Behavior Triggers: Automate messages based on clicks, form fills, or page views. Hyper-relevant timing.
- Segment Engine: Group contacts dynamically by history, location, or tier. Targeted outreach.
- ROI Dashboard: Real-time conversion tracking and cost analysis. Measurable marketing spend.

FAQs:

Q: Can we send WhatsApp messages without getting blocked?
A: Yes, we use the official WhatsApp Business API and configure approved templates to ensure compliance with Meta's policies.

Q: Does the system integrate with HubSpot or Salesforce?
A: Yes, our custom marketing automation flows can read data from and write results directly back to your main CRM.

Q: Can flows trigger based on what a customer actually does?
A: Yes - behavior triggers fire messages based on clicks, form fills, or page views, so outreach responds to real engagement instead of a fixed calendar.

